## 💡 Pro-Tips for Presenting This Code to Employers

* 
* Highlight Cost-Reduction: Emphasize how combining an append-only STREAM with a TASK containing a WHEN SYSTEM$STREAM_HAS_DATA(...) clause ensures you only spend compute resources when fresh files are dropped into the storage bucket.
* Demonstrate Dynamic Security: Run the verification scripts at the bottom of the SQL file during a live demo to show how switching from data_engineer_role to general_analyst_role automatically strips out or hides sensitive fields without needing separate filtered views.
